        "children": [],
        "outputs": {
          "content": "Yes — partly. According to Clover's support documentation, editing in CloverNote Pro on Mac works offline; only syncing to your account requires an internet connection [S2](https://clover-support.example/pricing).\n\nSo you can open and edit notes without a connection, but changes won't sync across devices until you're back online. I couldn't find details on whether offline access requires a prior sign-in or how long offline editing is permitted — the support page doesn't cover that.\n\n**Sources**\n- [S2](https://clover-support.example/pricing) — Clover Support, published 2026-11-11",
